<h1>Release 4.12 &mdash; October 2026</h1>
<p>This release ships the <strong>invoice export</strong> and retires the <em>old</em> PDF renderer. Owners: <ac:link><ri:user ri:userkey="abc12345" /></ac:link> and the billing team.</p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="info" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Customers on the Enterprise plan get the export a week early.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<h2>What's new</h2>
<ul>
  <li><p>CSV export of invoices (<a href="https://jira.imagile.dev/browse/PAY-311">PAY-311</a>)</p></li>
  <li><p>Faster search:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>results in under 200&nbsp;ms for 95% of queries</li>
      <li>typo tolerance for customer names</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Dark mode</span> moved to 4.13</li>
</ul>
<h2>Upgrade steps</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Back up the database</li>
  <li>Run the upgrade script:
    <ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">bash</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="linenumbers">true</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[./bin/upgrade --to 4.12 --dry-run
./bin/upgrade --to 4.12]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
  </li>
  <li>Restart the workers</li>
</ol>
